      "name": "[Blueprint] [Starlight - Billy] Knight's Belt - Lv.50",
      "desc": "This Blueprint can be used to unlock Starlight Billy's exclusive Tactical Prism crafting at the Smart Workshop. Obtained through investigations or purchased from Boojee's Store - Permanent Store - Blueprint Direct Sale.\nItem Effect: For each red Collectible in the Inventory or Safe, DMG taken from Boss and The Hound - Ulidim is reduced by 4%, up to 5 stacks max.\nWhen successfully performing a Block during <color=#FFFFFF>Special Attack: Drive Suppression</color>, gain 1 Charge stack, up to 1 stack, which <color=#2BAD00>increases the DMG</color> of the next <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack: High-Traction Wheels</color> or <color=#FFFFFF>EX Special Attack: Rocking Footwork</color> <color=#2BAD00>by 100%</color>.",
